{"title":"Ceramics class enrollment","genre":"design","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nDesign an enrollment report a community ceramics studio director can use to compare class sessions before setting next quarter's schedule. Fictional historical data for six class runs lists offered seats, enrollments, and waitlist requests. January: Tuesday evening 12/12/6, Saturday morning 10/8/0. February: Tuesday evening 12/11/0, Saturday morning 10/10/4. March: Tuesday evening 14/14/3, Saturday morning 12/12/7. A person may appear on both session waitlists, and each count describes a single class run. Make occupancy and unmet demand easy to interpret in a short staff meeting. Start from an empty directory and choose the deliverables, tools, and file layout.","works":{"9d73994d16a910d3":{"files":[{"name":"enrollment-report.html","bytes":5601,"sha256":"ad60bf68645a168bc4b45b1b6dced95994eef19044c5c1eb34e12aee93b0e178","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Ceramics studio enrollment report</title><style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#e9e6df;color:#242e2b;font:16px Arial,sans-serif}main{display:block;max-width:1040px;margin:24px auto;background:#fffdf7;padding:34px 44px 26px;border-top:7px solid #a84931}.top,footer{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase}.right{float:right;white-space:nowrap}header{position:relative;padding:25px 0 14px}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}h1,h2,h3{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:normal}h1{font-size:51px;letter-spacing:-2px}header p{max-width:78%;line-height:1.45;margin-top:9px}svg{position:absolute;right:5px;top:25px;width:105px;height:82px}.compare{display:table;width:100%;border-spacing:0;margin:8px 0 24px;background:#f1ede2}.panel{display:table-cell;width:50%;padding:17px 22px}.panel+.panel{border-left:4px solid #fffdf7}h3{font-size:23px}.numbers{margin:10px 0 6px;font-size:14px}.numbers strong{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-1px;color:#23564d}.numbers span{white-space:nowrap;float:right;margin-top:7px;color:#88412e}.numbers b{font-size:19px}.track{height:7px;background:#d6d3c8;margin:5px 0 8px}.track i{display:block;height:100%;background:#35695c}small{font-size:13px}h2{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.6px}.scroll{overflow-x:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:10px 0 6px;text-align:center}thead tr:first-child th{background:#334c43;color:white;padding:8px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:normal}thead tr:nth-child(2){background:#edece2}thead tr:nth-child(2) th{padding:7px 3px;font-size:12px}td,tbody th{padding:8px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #d2d2c8}tbody th{text-align:left;font-weight:normal}tbody td:nth-child(6),thead tr:first-child th:nth-child(3),thead tr:nth-child(2) th:nth-child(5){border-left:2px solid #fffdf7}.wait{color:#88412e;font-weight:bold}.note{font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#49534c}.decision{margin:18px 0 14px;padding:12px 17px;border-left:4px solid #ab5037;background:#f6eae1}.decision h2{font-size:21px}.decision p{margin:5px 0 0;line-height:1.4}footer{border-top:1px solid #a8aaa0;padding-top:9px;font-size:10px} @media screen and (max-width:700px){main{margin:0;padding:22px 16px}.compare,.panel{display:block;width:100%}.panel+.panel{border-left:0;border-top:4px solid #fffdf7}svg{display:none}header p{max-width:100%}table{min-width:630px}h1{font-size:40px}.top{font-size:10px}}\n@media print{body{background:white}main{margin:0;max-width:none;padding:18px 26px}*{-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}.scroll{overflow:visible}}\n@page{size:letter landscape;margin:8mm}\n</style><main><div class=\"top\">Community ceramics studio <span class=\"right\">January – March</span></div><header><h1>Class enrollment report</h1><p>Both sessions filled twice in three runs. Tuesday evening had higher occupancy overall, while Saturday morning drew the most waitlist requests in March.</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 90\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a84931\" stroke-width=\"3\"><ellipse cx=\"58\" cy=\"13\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"5\"/><path d=\"M38 13c7 15-20 22-20 40 0 14 11 24 26 28h28c15-4 26-14 26-28 0-18-27-25-20-40M24 38q34 13 68 0M20 46q38 14 76 0M19 54q39 14 78 0M23 65q35 12 70 0\"/></g></svg></header><section class=\"compare\" aria-label=\"Quarter totals by session\"><div class=\"panel\"><h3>Tuesday evening</h3><div class=\"numbers\"><strong>97.4%</strong> occupancy <span><b>9</b> waitlist requests</span></div><div class=\"track\"><i style=\"width:97.368%\"></i></div><small>37 enrollments across 38 offered seats</small></div><div class=\"panel\"><h3>Saturday morning</h3><div class=\"numbers\"><strong>93.8%</strong> occupancy <span><b>11</b> waitlist requests</span></div><div class=\"track\"><i style=\"width:93.750%\"></i></div><small>30 enrollments across 32 offered seats</small></div></section><h2>Class runs by month</h2><div class=\"scroll\"><table aria-label=\"Enrollment and waitlist requests for six individual class runs\"><thead><tr><th rowspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\">Month</th><th colspan=\"4\" scope=\"colgroup\">Tuesday evening</th><th colspan=\"4\" scope=\"colgroup\">Saturday morning</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"col\">Seats</th><th scope=\"col\">Enrolled</th><th scope=\"col\">Occupancy</th><th scope=\"col\">Waitlist</th><th scope=\"col\">Seats</th><th scope=\"col\">Enrolled</th><th scope=\"col\">Occupancy</th><th scope=\"col\">Waitlist</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">January</th><td>12</td><td>12</td><td>100%</td><td class=\"wait\">6</td><td>10</td><td>8</td><td>80%</td><td class=\"wait\">0</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">February</th><td>12</td><td>11</td><td>91.7%</td><td class=\"wait\">0</td><td>10</td><td>10</td><td>100%</td><td class=\"wait\">4</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">March</th><td>14</td><td>14</td><td>100%</td><td class=\"wait\">3</td><td>12</td><td>12</td><td>100%</td><td class=\"wait\">7</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\">Occupancy = enrollments ÷ offered seats. Quarter rates use total seats across the three runs.<br>Waitlists count requests per run. One person can request both sessions, so totals can include repeat requesters.</p><aside class=\"decision\"><h2>Next quarter’s scheduling decision</h2><p>Keep Tuesday evening on the schedule. Consider a small Saturday capacity trial first if March demand holds. March had 7 Saturday requests and 3 Tuesday requests, with both classes full.</p></aside><footer>Scheduling review <span class=\"right\">Fictional historical data</span></footer></main></html>"},{"name":"enrollment-report.pdf","bytes":28575,"sha256":"673ca5263d0cd9497b83dad3224a1b5409766c9e3a6a083ea8ec3b14ef67c69d","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/673ca5263d0cd9497b83dad3224a1b5409766c9e3a6a083ea8ec3b14ef67c69d-page1.jpg"}],"download":"data/release/assets/529d19bc651a24f48a9690723493884832c6c5ad5766ce0e49161e2b9da1f9c7.zip"},"9366d0118fd24057":{"files":[{"name":"class-runs.csv","bytes":250,"sha256":"3a9e14b1bea885d307226eef8f7ef98000bc6fb6732c4d71abeaeda6570dfd36","kind":"text","body":"Month,Session,Seats offered,Enrollments,Waitlist requests\nJanuary,Tuesday evening,12,12,6\nJanuary,Saturday morning,10,8,0\nFebruary,Tuesday evening,12,11,0\nFebruary,Saturday morning,10,10,4\nMarch,Tuesday evening,14,14,3\nMarch,Saturday morning,12,12,7\n"},{"name":"enrollment-report.html","bytes":10508,"sha256":"85669df340dd4bdcc74df05d77a0566d26c06e5d78d44b62050341eea16492c6","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Class enrollment | Community Ceramics Studio</title>\n<style>\n  :root { color-scheme: light; }\n  * { -webkit-box-sizing: border-box; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  main, header, section, footer { display: block; }\n  body { margin: 0; background: #eae5dc; color: #252c26; font: 15px/1.42 Arial, sans-serif; }\n  .report {\n    width: 100%; max-width: 816px; min-height: 1056px; margin: 24px auto;\n    background: #faf7f0; padding: 36px 46px 27px; border-top: 8px solid #a34a33;\n  }\n  .masthead { position: relative; border-bottom: 1px solid #bdb5a7; padding-bottom: 12px; }\n  .kicker, .period, .eyebrow, .session-label, thead {\n    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .095em; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .kicker { color: #8e3d29; }\n  .period { position: absolute; right: 0; top: 3px; white-space: nowrap; color: #535a51; }\n  h1, h2 { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; }\n  h1 { font-size: 57px; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.035em; margin-top: 19px; }\n  .intro { font-size: 16px; margin: 9px 0 25px; color: #484f45; }\n  h2 { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.02em; }\n  .eyebrow { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #535a51; margin: 0 0 7px; }\n  .comparison { display: table; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%; background: #e9ede3; border: 1px solid #c5cfc1; }\n  .session { display: table-cell; width: 50%; padding: 16px 17px 18px; }\n  .session + .session { border-left: 1px solid #c5cfc1; }\n  .session-label { margin: 0 0 6px; color: #324c3f; }\n  .metrics { display: table; width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; }\n  .metric { display: table-cell; margin: 0; vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.25; }\n  .metric + .metric { padding-left: 7px; }\n  .value { display: block; font: 32px/1.1 Georgia, serif; }\n  .wait { color: #8e3d29; }\n  .metric small { display: block; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 3px; }\n  .runs { margin-top: 29px; }\n  .runs h2 { margin-bottom: 7px; }\n  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .month-col { width: 15%; }\n  .session-col { width: 25%; }\n  .occupancy-col { width: 35%; }\n  .requests-col { width: 25%; }\n  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 9px 9px; vertical-align: middle; }\n  th:first-child, td:first-child { padding-left: 0; }\n  thead th { border-bottom: 1px solid #9f998d; color: #535a51; vertical-align: bottom; }\n  thead small { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }\n  tbody tr + tr { border-top: 1px solid #e4ded3; }\n  tbody + tbody { border-top: 1px solid #bdb5a7; }\n  tbody:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid #bdb5a7; }\n  tbody th[scope=\"rowgroup\"] { vertical-align: top; font-size: 14px; }\n  tbody th[scope=\"row\"] { font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; }\n  tbody tr:nth-child(2) th[scope=\"row\"] { padding-left: 9px; }\n  .bar {\n    display: inline-block; height: 8px; background: #e2e5db; vertical-align: middle;\n    border-radius: 1px; overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .bar b { display: block; height: 100%; background: #3d6555; }\n  .fill-bar { width: 49%; }\n  .occupied { display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 8px; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; }\n  .seats { font-size: 11px; font-weight: normal; color: #535a51; padding-left: 3px; }\n  .request-bar { width: 64%; background: #eee0d5; }\n  .request-bar b { background: #ad573e; }\n  .count { display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 9px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; }\n  .decision {\n    margin-top: 27px; background: #294b3e; color: #fffaf1; padding: 17px 19px 18px;\n  }\n  .decision .eyebrow { color: #d5e3d7; margin-bottom: 5px; }\n  .decision h2 { font-size: 23px; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .decision p:last-child { font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }\n  footer { color: #484f45; margin-top: 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  footer p { margin: 0 0 4px; }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 680px) {\n    .report { padding: 24px 24px 22px; margin: 0; min-height: auto; }\n    h1 { font-size: 43px; }\n    .fill-bar { display: block; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 2px; }\n    .occupied { padding-left: 0; }\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 430px) {\n    .report { padding-right: 16px; padding-left: 16px; }\n    .period { display: block; position: static; margin-top: 3px; }\n    .session { padding: 10px 9px; }\n    .value { font-size: 26px; }\n    .metric small { font-size: 11px; }\n    .month-col { width: 19%; }\n    .session-col { width: 25%; }\n    .occupancy-col { width: 29%; }\n    .requests-col { width: 27%; }\n    th, td { padding-right: 3px; padding-left: 4px; }\n    tbody tr:nth-child(2) th[scope=\"row\"] { padding-left: 4px; }\n    tbody th[scope=\"row\"], tbody th[scope=\"rowgroup\"] { font-size: 12px; }\n    .occupied { font-size: 12px; }\n    .seats { font-size: 10px; }\n    .count { padding-left: 4px; }\n  }\n  @page { size: letter; margin: 0; }\n  @media print {\n    html, body { margin: 0; background: #faf7f0; }\n    .report { margin: 0; max-width: none; min-height: 1055px; }\n    * { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }\n    .decision, table { break-inside: avoid; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"report\">\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"masthead\">\n      <span class=\"kicker\">Community Ceramics Studio</span>\n      <span class=\"period\">January–March · Fictional data</span>\n    </div>\n    <h1>Class enrollment</h1>\n    <p class=\"intro\">Six class runs filled 67 of 70 seats (95.7%) and drew 20 waitlist requests.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"comparison-title\">\n    <h2 class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"comparison-title\">Quarter at a glance</h2>\n    <div class=\"comparison\">\n      <section class=\"session\" aria-labelledby=\"tuesday-title\">\n        <h3 class=\"session-label\" id=\"tuesday-title\">Tuesday evening</h3>\n        <div class=\"metrics\">\n          <p class=\"metric\"><span class=\"value\">97.4%</span><small>37 of 38 seats filled</small></p>\n          <p class=\"metric\"><span class=\"value wait\">9</span><small>waitlist requests</small></p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"session\" aria-labelledby=\"saturday-title\">\n        <h3 class=\"session-label\" id=\"saturday-title\">Saturday morning</h3>\n        <div class=\"metrics\">\n          <p class=\"metric\"><span class=\"value\">93.8%</span><small>30 of 32 seats filled</small></p>\n          <p class=\"metric\"><span class=\"value wait\">11</span><small>waitlist requests</small></p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"runs\" aria-labelledby=\"runs-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"runs-title\">Class runs by month</h2>\n    <table aria-labelledby=\"runs-title\">\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"month-col\"><col class=\"session-col\"><col class=\"occupancy-col\"><col class=\"requests-col\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Month</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Session</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Occupancy<small>0–100% of seats offered</small></th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Waitlist<small>0–7 requests per run</small></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"rowgroup\" rowspan=\"2\">January</th><th scope=\"row\">Tuesday evening</th>\n          <td><span class=\"bar fill-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:100%\"></b></span><span class=\"occupied\">100% <span class=\"seats\">12/12</span></span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"bar request-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:85.7143%\"></b></span><span class=\"count\">6</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"row\">Saturday morning</th>\n          <td><span class=\"bar fill-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:80%\"></b></span><span class=\"occupied\">80% <span class=\"seats\">8/10</span></span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"bar request-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:0%\"></b></span><span class=\"count\">0</span></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"rowgroup\" rowspan=\"2\">February</th><th scope=\"row\">Tuesday evening</th>\n          <td><span class=\"bar fill-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:91.6667%\"></b></span><span class=\"occupied\">91.7% <span class=\"seats\">11/12</span></span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"bar request-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:0%\"></b></span><span class=\"count\">0</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"row\">Saturday morning</th>\n          <td><span class=\"bar fill-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:100%\"></b></span><span class=\"occupied\">100% <span class=\"seats\">10/10</span></span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"bar request-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:57.1429%\"></b></span><span class=\"count\">4</span></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"rowgroup\" rowspan=\"2\">March</th><th scope=\"row\">Tuesday evening</th>\n          <td><span class=\"bar fill-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:100%\"></b></span><span class=\"occupied\">100% <span class=\"seats\">14/14</span></span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"bar request-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:42.8571%\"></b></span><span class=\"count\">3</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"row\">Saturday morning</th>\n          <td><span class=\"bar fill-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:100%\"></b></span><span class=\"occupied\">100% <span class=\"seats\">12/12</span></span></td>\n          <td><span class=\"bar request-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b style=\"width:100%\"></b></span><span class=\"count\">7</span></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"decision\" aria-labelledby=\"decision-title\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Next-quarter discussion</p>\n    <h2 id=\"decision-title\">Consider a small Saturday capacity trial</h2>\n    <p>Saturday filled in February and March, with requests rising from 4 to 7. January had 2 open seats, so test added capacity on one run. Keep Tuesday capacity as a baseline. It drew 6 requests in January but had an open seat in February.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>\n    <p><strong>Occupancy</strong> is enrollments divided by seats offered. Quarter figures use summed enrollments and seats for each session.</p>\n    <p><strong>Waitlist requests</strong> are counted per run. A person may appear on both session waitlists, so combined counts can include the same person more than once.</p>\n  </footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},{"name":"enrollment-report.pdf","bytes":30503,"sha256":"395ec2033c3e49c77ea38394657605c64fe471d5be27e72beb5bf0215814eb43","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/395ec2033c3e49c77ea38394657605c64fe471d5be27e72beb5bf0215814eb43-page1.jpg"}],"download":"data/release/assets/5e53ef319be5dcfbff6ddb1265af2b10b0533dc6459ac0c921c1a30bfc82dfda.zip"}}}
